    "An extensive criminal record": "犯罪记录深重",
    "A criminal reputation": "恶名在外",
    "A disregard for the law": "蔑视法律",
    "A history of violence": "有暴力史",
    "Street cred": "街头声望",
    "CTO, CFO, or CEO of a company": "担任公司的 CTO、CFO 或 CEO",
    "Complete an infiltration": "完成一次潜入行动",
    // ---- src/Faction/ui/FactionRoot：派系页 ----
    "Hacking Contracts": "黑客契约",
    "Field Work": "外勤工作",
    "Security Work": "安保工作",
    "Purchase Augmentations": "购买义体",
    "Complete hacking contracts for your faction. Your effectiveness, which determines how much reputation you gain for this faction, is based completely on your hacking skill. You will gain hacking exp.": "为你的派系完成黑客契约。你的效率决定你为该派系获取声望的速度，它完全取决于你的黑客技能。你会获得黑客经验。",
    "Carry out field missions for your faction. Your effectiveness, which determines how much reputation you gain for this faction, is based on all of your stats equally. You will gain exp for all stats.": "为你的派系执行外勤任务。你的效率决定你为该派系获取声望的速度，它均衡地取决于你的所有属性。你会获得所有属性的经验。",
    "Serve in a security detail for your faction. Your effectiveness, which determines how much reputation you gain for this faction, is based on your combat stats and your hacking skill. You will gain exp for all combat stats and hacking.": "为你的派系执行安保任务。你的效率决定你为该派系获取声望的速度，它取决于你的战斗属性与黑客技能。你会获得所有战斗属性与黑客的经验。",
    "As your reputation with this faction rises, you will unlock augmentations, which you can purchase to enhance your abilities.": "随着你在本派系的声望提升，你将解锁义体，可以购买它们来强化自己的能力。",
    "Perform work/carry out assignments for your faction to help further its cause! By doing so, you will earn reputation for your faction. You will also gain reputation passively over time, although at a very slow rate.": "为你的派系工作/执行任务，以帮助推进它的事业！这样做你会为派系赢得声望。你也会随时间被动获得声望，尽管速度极慢。",
    "Note that the passive reputation gain is disabled in some BitNodes.": "注意：在某些 BitNode 中被动声望获取已被禁用。",
    "Earning reputation will allow you to purchase augmentations through this faction, which are powerful upgrades that enhance your abilities.": "获取声望将允许你通过本派系购买义体——它们是强化你能力的强力升级。",
    "Special Campaign": "特殊行动",
    "Some factions are developing special campaigns for researching breakthrough technology or executing initiatives. Some campaigns may be complete, while others remain unfinished. Explore them now, and return later if a campaign is not yet complete to see what unfolds.": "一些派系正在开展特殊行动，用于研究突破性技术或推行计划。有些行动已经完成，有些尚未结束。现在就去探索；若行动尚未完成，日后再回来看看会如何发展。",
    // ---- src/Faction/ui/FactionsRoot：派系列表页 ----
