    "Throughout the game you may receive invitations from factions. There are many different factions, and each faction has different criteria for determining its potential members. Joining a faction and furthering its cause is crucial to progressing in the game and unlocking endgame content.": "在游戏过程中你会收到派系的邀请。派系众多，且每个派系筛选潜在成员的标准各不相同。加入派系并推进其事业，是游戏进程与解锁终局内容的关键。",
