  // ============ src/Augmentation/Augmentations.ts：全部义体描述（info）============
  BitburnerZH.exact({
    "The body is genetically re-engineered so that it produces the ADR-V1 pheromone, an artificial pheromone discovered by scientists. The ADR-V1 pheromone, when excreted, triggers feelings of admiration and approval in other people.": "身体经过基因再设计，可持续产生科学家发现的人工信息素 ADR-V1。ADR-V1 排出体外时，会在他人的心中唤起钦佩与好感。",
    "The body is genetically re-engineered so that it produces the ADR-V2 pheromone, which is similar to but more potent than ADR-V1. This pheromone, when excreted, triggers feelings of admiration, approval, and respect in others.": "身体经过基因再设计，产生与 ADR-V1 相似但更强烈的 ADR-V2 信息素。该信息素排出体外时，会在他人心中唤起钦佩、好感与尊重。",
    "A network consisting of millions of nanoprocessors is embedded into the brain. The network is meant to mimic the way a biological brain solves a problem, with each nanoprocessor acting similar to the way a neuron would in a neural network. However, these nanoprocessors are programmed to perform computations much faster than organic neurons, allowing the user to solve much more complex problems at a much faster rate.": "数百万纳米处理器构成的网络被嵌入大脑。该网络模仿生物大脑解题的方式，每个纳米处理器如同神经网络中的神经元。但这些纳米处理器的运算速度远超有机神经元，让使用者能以更快的速度解决更复杂的问题。",
    "The body is injected with a chemical that artificially induces synaptic potentiation, otherwise known as the strengthening of synapses. This results in enhanced cognitive abilities.": "体内注入了一种人工诱发突触增强（即突触强化）的化学物质，从而提升认知能力。",
    "Pheromone extruder injected in the thoracodorsal nerve. Emits a pleasing scent guaranteed to make conversational partners more agreeable.": "沿胸背神经注入的信息素分泌器。散发令人愉悦的气味，确保让对话对象更配合。",
    "A chip containing the psyche of the greatest BitRunner to ever exist. Installing this relic significantly increases ALL of your stats. However, it may have unintended consequences on the user's mental well-being.": "一枚芯片，内含史上最伟大 BitRunner 的心智。安装这件遗物会大幅提升你的所有属性。但它可能对使用者的心理健康造成意想不到的后果。",
    "Cybernetic arms created from plasteel and carbon fibers that completely replace the user's organic arms.": "用塑料钢与碳纤维制成的机械臂，完全取代使用者的有机手臂。",
    "Cybernetic legs, created from plasteel and carbon fibers, enhance running speed.": "用塑料钢与碳纤维制成的机械腿，可提升奔跑速度。",
    "The spine is reconstructed using plasteel and carbon fibers. It is now capable of stimulating and regulating neural signals passing through the spinal cord, improving senses and reaction speed. The 'Bionic Spine' also interfaces with all other 'Bionic' implants.": "脊柱以塑料钢与碳纤维重建，能够刺激并调节穿过脊髓的神经信号，提升感官与反应速度。「仿生脊柱」还会与所有其他「仿生」植入体联动。",
    "A small brain implant embedded in the cerebrum. This regulates and improves the brain's computing capabilities.": "植入大脑的小型脑部芯片，调节并提升大脑的计算能力。",
    "A powered exoskeleton suit designed as armor for Bladeburners units. This exoskeleton is incredibly adaptable and can protect the wearer from blunt, piercing, concussive, thermal, chemical, and electric trauma. It also enhances the user's physical abilities.": "为刃行者部队设计的动力外骨骼护甲。这副外骨骼适应性极强，可保护穿戴者免受钝击、穿刺、震荡、高温、化学与电击伤害，同时强化使用者的体能。",
    "Upgrades the BLADE-51b Tesla Armor with a plasma energy propulsion system that is capable of projecting an energy shielding force field.": "为 BLADE-51b 特斯拉护甲加装等离子能量推进系统，可展开能量护盾力场。",
    "Upgrades the BLADE-51b Tesla Armor with an AI Information Processing Unit that was specially designed to analyze Synthoid related data and information.": "为 BLADE-51b 特斯拉护甲加装专为分析仿生人（Synthoid）数据与情报而设计的 AI 信息处理单元。",
    "Upgrades the BLADE-51b Tesla Armor Unibeam augmentation to use a multiple-fiber system. This upgraded weapon uses multiple fiber laser modules that combine together to form a single, more powerful beam of up to 2000MW.": "将 BLADE-51b 特斯拉护甲的单束炮升级为多光纤系统。升级后的武器融合多个光纤激光模块，形成一道最高 2000MW 的更强光束。",
    "Upgrades the BLADE-51b Tesla Armor with Ion Power Cells, which are capable of more efficiently storing and using power.": "为 BLADE-51b 特斯拉护甲换装离子电池，储能与供电效率更高。",
    "Upgrades the BLADE-51b Tesla Armor with a concentrated deuterium-fluoride laser weapon. Its precision and accuracy makes it useful for quickly neutralizing threats while keeping casualties to a minimum.": "为 BLADE-51b 特斯拉护甲加装聚焦氘化氟激光武器。其精准度可用于迅速解除威胁并将伤亡降到最低。",
    "A cybernetic foot augmentation that was specifically created for Bladeburners during the Synthoid Uprising. The organic musculature of the human foot is enhanced with flexible carbon nanotube matrices that are controlled by intelligent servomotors.": "仿生人暴动期间专为刃行者制造的机械足部改造。人脚的有机肌肉由柔性碳纳米管矩阵增强，并由智能伺服电机控制。",
    "A highly advanced matter phase-shifter module that is embedded in the brainstem and cerebellum. This augmentation allows the user to project and control a holographic simulacrum within an extremely large radius. These specially modified holograms were specifically weaponized by Bladeburner units to be used against Synthoids.": "植入脑干与小脑的高度先进物质相移模块。使用者可在极大半径内投射并操控全息拟像。这些特制的全息影像被刃行者部队武器化，用于对抗仿生人。",
    "A set of retractable plasteel blades that are implanted in the arm, underneath the skin.": "一组可伸缩的塑料钢刀刃，植入手臂皮下。",
    "The CRTX42-AA gene is injected into the genome. The CRTX42-AA is an artificially-synthesized gene that targets the visual and prefrontal cortex and improves cognitive abilities.": "将 CRTX42-AA 注入基因组。CRTX42-AA 是人工合成基因，作用于视觉皮层与前额叶皮层，提升认知能力。",
    "A collection of digital assets saved on a small chip. The chip is implanted into your wrist. A small jack in the chip allows you to connect it to a computer and upload the assets.": "一系列数字资产保存在一枚小芯片上。芯片植入你的手腕，芯片上的小插口让你能将其连接电脑并上传资产。",
    "Opto-occipito implant to process visual signals before brain interpretation.": "光枕叶植入体，在大脑解读之前先行处理视觉信号。",
    "The rib cage is augmented to continuously release boosters into the bloodstream which increase the oxygen-carrying capacity of blood.": "胸腔经过强化，可持续向血液释放增效剂，提高血液的携氧能力。",
    "An upgraded version of the 'Combat Rib' augmentation that adds potent stimulants which improve focus and endurance while decreasing reaction time and fatigue.": "「战斗肋骨」的升级版本，添加强效兴奋剂，提升专注与耐力，缩短反应时间、减轻疲劳。",
    "The latest version of the 'Combat Rib' augmentation releases advanced anabolic steroids that improve muscle mass and physical performance while being safe and free of side effects.": "「战斗肋骨」最新版本可释放安全的先进合成类固醇，增加肌肉量、提升体能且无副作用。",
    "The thoracic cavity is equipped with a small chamber designed to hold and sustain hydrogen plasma. The plasma is used to generate power through nuclear fusion, providing limitless amounts of clean energy for the body.": "胸腔内装有一个容纳并维持氢等离子体的小型腔室。等离子体通过核聚变发电，为身体提供近乎无限的清洁能源。",
    "The first generation of Cranial Signal Processors. Cranial Signal Processors are a set of specialized microprocessors that are attached to neurons in the brain. These chips process neural signals to quickly and automatically perform specific computations so that the brain doesn't have to.": "第一代颅信号处理器。颅信号处理器是一组附着于大脑神经元的专用微处理器。这些芯片处理神经信号，快速自动地完成特定计算，让大脑不必亲力亲为。",
    "The second generation of Cranial Signal Processors. Cranial Signal Processors are a set of specialized microprocessors that are attached to neurons in the brain. These chips process neural signals to quickly and automatically perform specific computations so that the brain doesn't have to.": "第二代颅信号处理器。颅信号处理器是一组附着于大脑神经元的专用微处理器。这些芯片处理神经信号，快速自动地完成特定计算，让大脑不必亲力亲为。",
    "The third generation of Cranial Signal Processors. Cranial Signal Processors are a set of specialized microprocessors that are attached to neurons in the brain. These chips process neural signals to quickly and automatically perform specific computations so that the brain doesn't have to.": "第三代颅信号处理器。颅信号处理器是一组附着于大脑神经元的专用微处理器。这些芯片处理神经信号，快速自动地完成特定计算，让大脑不必亲力亲为。",
    "The fourth generation of Cranial Signal Processors. Cranial Signal Processors are a set of specialized microprocessors that are attached to neurons in the brain. These chips process neural signals to quickly and automatically perform specific computations so that the brain doesn't have to.": "第四代颅信号处理器。颅信号处理器是一组附着于大脑神经元的专用微处理器。这些芯片处理神经信号，快速自动地完成特定计算，让大脑不必亲力亲为。",
    "The fifth generation of Cranial Signal Processors. Cranial Signal Processors are a set of specialized microprocessors that are attached to neurons in the brain. These chips process neural signals to quickly and automatically perform specific computations so that the brain doesn't have to.": "第五代颅信号处理器。颅信号处理器是一组附着于大脑神经元的专用微处理器。这些芯片处理神经信号，快速自动地完成特定计算，让大脑不必亲力亲为。",
    "A brain implant that provides an interface for direct, wireless communication between a computer's main memory and the mind. This implant allows the user to not only access a computer's memory, but also alter and delete it.": "一种脑部植入体，在计算机主存与心智之间提供直接的无线通信接口。使用者不仅能访问计算机内存，还能修改与删除它。",
    "Synthetic skin that is grafted onto the body. This skin consists of millions of nanobots capable of projecting high-density muon beams, creating an energy barrier around the user.": "移植到体表的合成皮肤。皮肤由数百万纳米机器人组成，可投射高密度 μ 子束，在使用者周围形成能量屏障。",
    "A neural implant that enhances the user's ability to resonate with others. It is capable of analyzing and interpreting the emotions of those nearby, allowing the user to better understand and influence them.": "一种神经植入体，增强使用者与他人共鸣的能力。它能分析并解读附近之人的情绪，让使用者更好地理解并影响他们。",
    "A DNA recombination of the EMS-4 Gene. This genetic engineering technique was originally used on Bladeburners during the Synthoid uprising to induce wakefulness and concentration, suppress fear, reduce empathy, improve reflexes, and improve memory, among other things.": "EMS-4 基因的 DNA 重组技术。该基因工程最初用于仿生人暴动期间的刃行者，可诱发清醒与专注、抑制恐惧、降低共情、改善反射与记忆等。",
    "A thin device embedded inside the arm containing a wireless module capable of connecting to nearby networks. Once connected, the Netburner Module is capable of capturing and processing all of the traffic on that network. By itself, the Embedded Netburner Module does not do much, but a variety of very powerful upgrades can be installed that allow you to fully control the traffic on a network.": "嵌入手臂内部的薄型装置，内含可连接附近网络的无线模块。连接后，燃网模块可捕获并处理该网络上的全部流量。内置燃网模块本身作用有限，但可加装多种强力升级，让你完全掌控网络流量。",
    "Installs the Analyze Engine for the Embedded Netburner Module, which is a CPU cluster that vastly outperforms the Netburner Module's native single-core processor.": "为内置燃网模块安装分析引擎——一组 CPU 集群，性能远超模块原生的单核处理器。",
    "The Core library is an implant that upgrades the firmware of the Embedded Netburner Module. This upgrade allows the Embedded Netburner Module to generate its own data on a network.": "核心库是升级内置燃网模块固件的植入体。此升级让内置燃网模块能在网络中生成自己的数据。",
    "The Core V2 library is an implant that upgrades the firmware of the Embedded Netburner Module. This upgraded firmware allows the Embedded Netburner Module to control information on a network by re-routing traffic, spoofing IP addresses, and altering the data inside network packets.": "核心 V2 库是升级内置燃网模块固件的植入体。升级后的固件可让模块通过重定向流量、伪造 IP 地址、篡改网络包内数据来控制网络信息。",
    "The Core V3 library is an implant that upgrades the firmware of the Embedded Netburner Module. This upgraded firmware allows the Embedded Netburner Module to seamlessly inject code into any device on a network.": "核心 V3 库是升级内置燃网模块固件的植入体。升级后的固件可让模块无缝地将代码注入网络中的任意设备。",
    "This implant installs a Direct Memory Access (DMA) controller into the Embedded Netburner Module. This allows the Module to send and receive data directly to and from the main memory of devices on a network.": "该植入体为内置燃网模块安装直接内存访问（DMA）控制器，使模块可直接与网络中设备的主存收发数据。",
    "Electrical signals are used to induce a new, artificial form of myelinogenesis in the human body. This process results in the proliferation of new, synthetic myelin sheaths in the nervous system. These myelin sheaths can propagate neuro-signals much faster than their organic counterparts, leading to greater processing speeds and better brain function.": "以电信号在人体内诱发全新的人工髓鞘生成。神经系统将大量生成新的合成髓鞘，其传导神经信号的速度远快于有机髓鞘，带来更快的处理速度与更佳的大脑功能。",
    "A cranial implant that greatly assists in the user's ability to analyze social situations and interactions. The system uses a wide variety of factors such as facial expression, body language, voice tone, and inflection to determine the best course of action during social situations. The implant also uses deep learning software to continuously learn new behavior patterns and how to best respond.": "一种颅部植入体，大幅辅助使用者分析社交场景与互动的能力。系统综合运用面部表情、肢体语言、语音语调等因素来确定社交场合的最佳应对方式，并借助深度学习软件持续学习新行为模式与最佳回应。",
    "Ballistic-grade protective and retractable eyewear that was designed specifically for Bladeburner units. This is implanted by installing a mechanical frame in the skull's orbit. This frame interfaces with the brain and allows the user to automatically extrude and extract the eyewear. The eyewear protects against debris, shrapnel, lasers, blinding flashes, and gas. It is also embedded with a data processing chip that can be programmed to display an AR HUD to assist the user in field missions.": "专为刃行者部队设计的防弹级可伸缩护目镜。通过在眼眶处安装机械框架植入，框架与大脑联动，使用者可自动伸出与收回护目镜。护目镜可防御碎片、弹片、激光、眩光与毒气，并内置数据处理芯片，可编程显示 AR 平视显示器，辅助外勤任务。",
    "Transtinatium VVD reticulator used in optico-sterbing recognition.": "用于光学净化识别的超稳钛 VVD 网格器。",
    "A cranial implant that stops procrastination by blocking specific neural pathways in the brain.": "一种颅部植入体，通过阻断大脑中特定神经通路来根除拖延。",
    "An implant that, when activated, makes the speaker sound unbelievably reasonable and plausible to listeners for the next hour. It requires no concentration from the user, and only a verbal activation component. It even affects most electronic detection methods.": "一种植入体，激活后的一小时内，说话者的言语会令听众觉得不可思议地合情合理。无需使用者集中注意力，仅需口头激活。它甚至能影响多数电子检测手段。",
    "An aural implant that enhances the user's ability to communicate and persuade others. The implant uses a predictive model that lets the user say precisely what their audience wants to hear. This implant is commonly used by many high-level executives and government officials.": "一种听觉植入体，增强使用者沟通与说服他人的能力。植入体内置预测模型，让使用者句句都说在听众心坎上。许多企业高管与政府官员都使用这种植入体。",
    "A serum that permanently enhances many aspects of human capabilities, including strength, speed, immune system enhancements, and mitochondrial efficiency. The serum was originally developed by the Chinese military in an attempt to create super soldiers.": "一种永久增强人类多项能力的血清，涵盖力量、速度、免疫系统与线粒体效率。该血清最初由中国军方为制造超级士兵而研发。",
    "An upgrade to the 'Bionic Arms' augmentation. It infuses the prosthetic arms with an advanced graphene material to make them stronger and lighter.": "「仿生臂」的升级版本。以先进石墨烯材料强化义臂，使其更强更轻。",
    "An upgrade to the 'Bionic Legs' augmentation. The legs are fused with graphene, greatly enhancing jumping ability.": "「仿生腿」的升级版本。腿部与石墨烯融合，跳跃能力大幅提升。",
    "An upgrade to the 'Bionic Spine' augmentation. The spine is fused with graphene which enhances durability and supercharges all body functions.": "「仿生脊柱」的升级版本。脊柱与石墨烯融合，增强耐久并为全身机能充能。",
    "Graphene is grafted and fused into the skeletal structure, enhancing bone density and tensile strength.": "石墨烯被移植并与骨骼结构融合，提升骨密度与抗拉强度。",
    "An upgrade to the BrachiBlades augmentation. It infuses the retractable blades with an advanced graphene material, making them stronger and lighter.": "臂刃的升级版本。以先进石墨烯材料注入可伸缩刀刃，更强更轻。",
    "Uploads the architecture and design details of a Hacknet Node's CPU into the brain. This allows the user to engineer custom hardware and software for the Hacknet Node that provides better performance.": "将 Hacknet 节点 CPU 的架构与设计细节上传至大脑。使用者可为 Hacknet 节点定制硬件与软件，获得更佳性能。",
    "Uploads the architecture and design details of a Hacknet Node's main-memory cache into the brain. This allows the user to engineer custom cache hardware for the Hacknet Node that offers better performance.": "将 Hacknet 节点主存缓存的架构与设计细节上传至大脑。使用者可为 Hacknet 节点定制缓存硬件，获得更佳性能。",
    "Installs a Direct-Neural Interface jack into the arm that is capable of connecting to a Hacknet Node. This lets the user access and manipulate the Node's processing logic using electrochemical signals.": "在手臂中安装可连接 Hacknet 节点的直连神经接口插口。使用者可用电化学信号访问并操纵节点的处理逻辑。",
    "Installs a Direct-Neural Interface jack into the arm that is capable of connecting to a Hacknet Node. This lets the user access and manipulate the Node's kernel using electrochemical signals.": "在手臂中安装可连接 Hacknet 节点的直连神经接口插口。使用者可用电化学信号访问并操纵节点内核。",
    "Uploads the architecture and design details of a Hacknet Node's Network Interface Card (NIC) into the brain. This allows the user to engineer a custom NIC for the Hacknet Node that offers better performance.": "将 Hacknet 节点网卡（NIC）的架构与设计细节上传至大脑。使用者可为 Hacknet 节点定制网卡，获得更佳性能。",
    "A heart implant that greatly increases the body's ability to effectively use and pump blood.": "一种心脏植入体，大幅提升身体有效利用与泵送血液的能力。",
    "A brain implant developed by ECorp. They do not reveal what exactly the implant does, but they promise that it will greatly enhance your abilities.": "E公司研发的脑部植入体。他们不透露植入体的具体功能，但保证它会大幅提升你的能力。",
    "Magneto-turboencabulator based on technology by Micha Eike Siemon, increases the user's electro-magnetic sensitivity.": "基于 Micha Eike Siemon 技术的磁涡轮变换器（turboencabulator），增强使用者的电磁敏感度。",
    "The left arm of a legendary BitRunner who ascended beyond this world. It projects a light blue energy shield that protects the exposed inner parts. Even though it contains no weapons, the advanced tungsten titanium alloy increases the user's strength to unbelievable levels.": "一位飞升超脱此世的传奇 BitRunner 的左臂。它投射淡蓝色能量护盾，保护外露的内部构件。虽无任何武器，但先进的钨钛合金将使用者的力量提升到不可思议的境界。",
    "A pair of mini plasma cannons embedded into the hands. The Hyperion is capable of rapidly firing bolts of high-density plasma. The weapon is meant to be used against augmented enemies as the ionized nature of the plasma disrupts the electrical systems of Augmentations. However, it can also be effective against non-augmented enemies due to its high temperature and concussive force.": "嵌入双手的一对微型等离子炮。「海伯利安」可快速发射高密度等离子弹。等离子电离特性可扰乱义体电气系统，专为对付义体敌人而设计；凭借高温与冲击，对非义体敌人同样有效。",
    "A pair of mini plasma cannons embedded into the hands. This augmentation is more advanced and powerful than the original V1 model. This V2 model is more power-efficient, more accurate, and can fire plasma bolts at a much higher velocity than the V1 model.": "嵌入双手的一对微型等离子炮。该义体比原版 V1 更先进强力。V2 型号更省电、更精准，等离子弹的初速远高于 V1。",
    "A bionic eye implant that enhances the user's sight far beyond that of a natural human. Embedded circuitry within the implant provides the ability to detect heat and movement through solid objects such as walls, thus providing 'x-ray vision'-like capabilities.": "仿生眼植入体，让使用者的视力远超自然人。植入体内置电路可透过墙壁等固体探测热源与移动，实现类似「X 光视觉」的能力。",
    "A tiny chip that sits behind the retina. This implant lets the user visually detect infrared radiation.": "一枚置于视网膜后方的小芯片，让使用者能以视觉感知红外辐射。",
    "A drug which incites a DNA modification to the body's extracellular matrix (ECM). This improves the ECM's ability to structurally support the body, granting heightened strength and durability.": "一种药物，可诱发细胞外基质（ECM）的 DNA 修饰，增强 ECM 对身体的结构支撑能力，带来更强的力量与耐久。",
    "Neodynic retention fjengeln spoofer using -φ karmions, net positive effect on implantee's delta wave.": "使用负 φ 卡米子的钕音保持 fjen gel 欺骗器，对植入者的 δ 波有净正向效应。",
    "A skin implant that reinforces the skin with highly advanced synthetic cells. These cells, when powered, have a negative refractive index. As a result, they bend light around the skin, making the user much harder to see with the naked eye.": "一种皮肤植入体，以高度先进的合成细胞强化皮肤。这些细胞通电后呈负折射率，使光线绕过皮肤弯曲，裸眼更难察觉使用者。",
    "This is a more advanced version of the LuminCloaking-V1 augmentation. This skin implant reinforces the skin with highly advanced synthetic cells. These cells, when powered, are capable of not only bending light but also of bending heat, making the user more resilient as well as stealthy.": "LuminCloaking-V1 的进阶版本。皮肤植入体以先进合成细胞强化皮肤。细胞通电后不仅能弯曲光线，还能弯曲热量，让使用者既坚韧又隐蔽。",
    "A cranial implant that increases the attractive force of the wearer. (Even its inventor isn't quite sure how it works).": "一种颅部植入体，提升穿戴者的吸引力。（连它的发明者也不太确定原理）。",
    "Extra-ocular neurons taken from old martial arts master. Injecting them gives the user the ability to predict the enemy's movement.": "取自武学宗师的眼外神经元。注射后，使用者获得预判敌人动作的能力。",
    "Synthetic nanofibers are woven into the skin's extracellular matrix using electrospinning, which improves its regenerative and extracellular homeostasis abilities.": "以静电纺丝将合成纳米纤维织入皮肤细胞外基质，提升其再生与细胞外稳态能力。",
    "A highly advanced techno-organic drug that is injected into the skeletal and integumentary system. The drug permanently modifies the DNA of the body's skin and bone cells, granting them the ability to repair and restructure themselves.": "一种高度先进的机电有机药物，注入骨骼与皮肤系统。药物永久改写皮肤与骨细胞的 DNA，使其获得自我修复与重构的能力。",
    "A microprocessor that accelerates the processing speed of biological neural networks. This is a cranial implant that is embedded inside the brain.": "一种加速生物神经网络处理速度的微处理器，为嵌入大脑内部的颅部植入体。",
    "Chemical injections are used to permanently alter and strengthen the brain's neuronal circuits, strengthening the ability to retain information.": "通过化学注射永久改变并强化大脑神经回路，增强记忆留存能力。",
    "A cranial implant that intelligently stimulates certain areas of the brain in order to improve cognitive functions.": "一种颅部植入体，智能刺激大脑特定区域，以改善认知功能。",
    "A drug that genetically modifies the neurons in the brain, resulting in neurons that continuously regenerate and strengthen themselves.": "一种对大脑神经元进行基因改造的药物，使神经元不断自我再生与强化。",
    "Undetectable adamantium nanobots injected in the user's bloodstream. The NeuroFlux Governor monitors and regulates all aspects of the human body, essentially 'governing' the body. By doing so, it improves the user's performance for most actions.": "不可检测的振金（adamantium）纳米机器人注入使用者血液。神经通量调控器监测并调节人体各方面，本质上是在「统御」身体，从而提升使用者大多数行动的表现。",
    "A brain implant that provides a high-bandwidth, direct neural link between your mind and the BitRunners' data servers, which reportedly contain the largest database of hacking tools and information in the world.": "一种脑部植入体，在你的心智与比特行者的数据服务器之间建立高带宽直连神经链路。这些服务器据称拥有全球最大的黑客工具与信息数据库。",
    "The brain is surgically re-engineered to have increased neuronal density by decreasing the neuron gap junction. Then, the body is genetically modified to enhance the production and capabilities of its neural stem cells.": "通过外科手术减少神经元间隙连接、提高神经元密度来重建大脑；随后对身体进行基因改造，增强神经干细胞的生成与能力。",
    "A brain implant carefully assembled around the synapses, which micromanages the activity and levels of various neuroreceptor chemicals and modulates electrical activity to optimize concentration, allowing the user to multitask much more effectively.": "一种围绕突触精细组装的脑部植入体，微观管理各类神经受体化学物质的活动与水平，并调节电活动以优化专注度，让使用者更高效地多任务处理。",
    "A decentralized cranial implant that improves the brain's ability to learn. It is installed by releasing millions of nanobots into the human brain, each of which attaches to a different neural pathway to enhance the brain's ability to retain and retrieve information.": "一种分布式颅部植入体，提升大脑的学习能力。植入方式是向人脑释放数百万纳米机器人，每个附着于不同的神经通路，增强大脑记忆与提取信息的能力。",
    "A decentralized cranial implant that improves the brain's ability to learn. This is a more powerful version of the Neurotrainer I augmentation, but it does not require Neurotrainer I to be installed as a prerequisite.": "一种分布式颅部植入体，提升大脑的学习能力。这是神经训练器 I 的更强力版本，但无需先安装神经训练器 I。",
    "A decentralized cranial implant that improves the brain's ability to learn. This is a more powerful version of the Neurotrainer I and Neurotrainer II augmentation, but it does not require either of them to be installed as a prerequisite.": "一种分布式颅部植入体，提升大脑的学习能力。这是神经训练器 I 与 II 的更强力版本，但无需先安装其中任何一个。",
    "This torso implant automatically injects nootropic supplements into the bloodstream to improve memory, increase focus, and provide other cognitive enhancements.": "这种躯干植入体自动向血液注射促智补剂，改善记忆、提升专注并提供其他认知增强。",
    "A thermal-powered artificial nutrition generator. Endogenously synthesizes glucose, amino acids, and vitamins, and redistributes them across the body. The device is powered by the body's naturally wasted energy in the form of heat.": "一种热能驱动的人工营养发生器。内源性合成葡萄糖、氨基酸与维生素并重新分配至全身。设备动力来自身体以热量形式自然耗散的能源。",
    "The body is genetically re-engineered to maintain a state of negligible senescence, preventing the body from deteriorating with age.": "身体经过基因再设计，维持在近乎可忽略的衰老状态，防止身体随年龄衰退。",
    "OmniTek's data and information repository is uploaded into your brain, enhancing your programming and hacking abilities.": "OmniTek 的数据与情报库被上传到你的大脑，提升你的编程与黑客能力。",
    "A bionic shoulder augmentation for the right shoulder. Using cybernetics, the ORION-MKIV shoulder enhances the strength and dexterity of the user's right arm. It also provides protection due to its crystallized graphene plating.": "右肩的仿生肩部改造。ORION-MKIV 肩甲借助机电系统增强使用者右臂的力量与灵巧，并以结晶石墨烯护板提供防护。",
    "Installs a Direct-Neural Interface jack into your arm that is compatible with most computers. Connecting to a computer through this jack allows you to interface with it using the brain's electrochemical signals.": "在手臂中安装兼容多数计算机的直连神经接口插口。通过插口连接计算机后，你可以用大脑的电化学信号与之交互。",
    "This is an additional installation that upgrades the functionality of the PC Direct-Neural Interface augmentation. When connected to a computer, the Neural Network upgrade allows the user to use their own brain's processing power to aid the computer in computational tasks.": "这是对 PC 直连神经接口的追加植入。连接计算机时，神经网络升级让使用者能用自己的大脑算力协助计算机完成计算任务。",
    "This is a submodule upgrade to the PC Direct-Neural Interface augmentation. It improves the performance of the interface and gives the user more control options to a connected computer.": "这是 PC 直连神经接口的子模块升级。它提升接口性能，并让使用者对已连接的计算机拥有更多控制选项。",
    "A 'Probability Computation Matrix' is installed in the frontal cortex. This implant uses advanced mathematical algorithms to rapidly identify and compute statistical outcomes of nearly every situation.": "在额叶皮层植入「概率计算矩阵」。该植入体运用高等数学算法，快速识别并计算几乎任何情境的统计结果。",
    "Chloroplasts are added to epidermal stem cells and are applied to the body using a skin graft. The result is photosynthetic skin cells, allowing users to generate their own energy and nutrition using solar power.": "在表皮干细胞中加入叶绿体，并以皮肤移植方式施于全身。皮肤细胞因此具备光合作用，使用者可利用太阳能自行产生能量与营养。",
    "The body's nerves are attached with polypyrrole nanocircuits that are capable of capturing wasted energy, in the form of heat, and converting it back into usable power.": "在神经上附着聚吡咯纳米电路，可捕获以热量形式耗散的能源并转化为可用电力。",
    "A cutting-edge knowledgebase entirely built off of nanotech rod-logic, training the user on social engineering. Thought to be stolen technology, its existence has been a secret until recently.": "一套完全由纳米棒逻辑构建的前沿知识库，训练使用者的社会工程学。据信是失窃技术，其存在直到最近仍是秘密。",
    "A brain implant that wirelessly connects you to the Illuminati's quantum supercomputer, allowing you to access and use its incredible computing power.": "一种脑部植入体，将你在无线上直连光照会的量子超级计算机，让你得以使用其惊人的算力。",
    "A cranial implant that affects the user's personality, making them better at negotiation in social situations.": "一种颅部植入体，微调使用者性格，使他们在社交场合更善于谈判。",
    "Makes the wearer a better leader and mentor by greatly increasing their awareness of social dynamics. Not actually a standard implant, but rather a series of training courses and seminars, led by a famous speaker named Denis.": "大幅提升穿戴者对社会动态的认知，使其成为更好的领导者与导师。它并非标准植入体，而是一系列由知名演说家 Denis 主持的训练课程与研讨会。",
    "The SPTN-97 gene is injected into the genome. The SPTN-97 gene is an artificially synthesized gene that was developed by DARPA to create super-soldiers through genetic modification. The gene was outlawed in 2056.": "将 SPTN-97 基因注入基因组。SPTN-97 是 DARPA 为基因改造超级士兵而研发的人工合成基因。该基因已于 2056 年被列为非法。",
    "A crude but functional matter phase-shifter module that is embedded in the brainstem and cerebellum. This augmentation was developed by criminal organizations and allows the user to project and control holographic simulacrums within a large radius. These simulacrums are commonly used for espionage and surveillance work.": "植入脑干与小脑的粗糙但可用的物质相移模块。该义体由犯罪组织开发，允许使用者在大半径内投射并操控全息拟像，常用于间谍与监视活动。",
    "A bionic jaw that contains advanced hardware and software capable of psychoanalyzing and profiling the personality of others using optical imaging software.": "一种仿生下颌，内置先进软硬件，可用光学成像软件对他人进行心理分析与人格侧写。",
    "A cochlear implant that helps the player detect and locate enemies using sound propagation.": "一种耳蜗植入体，借助声音传播帮助玩家侦测并定位敌人。",
    "An advanced neural implant that improves your speaking abilities, making you more convincing and likable in conversations and overall improving your social interactions.": "一种先进神经植入体，提升你的言谈能力，让你在对话中更有说服力、更讨人喜欢，全面改善社交互动。",
    "A cochlear implant with an embedded computer that analyzes incoming speech. The embedded computer processes characteristics of incoming speech, such as tone and inflection, to pick up on subtle cues and aid in social interactions.": "一种内置计算机、可分析所闻言语的耳蜗植入体。内置计算机处理语音的语调、起伏等特征，捕捉微妙线索以辅助社交互动。",
    "Allison \"Mother\" Stanek imparts you with her gift. An experimental Augmentation implanted at the base of the neck. It allows you to overclock your entire system by carefully changing the configuration.": "艾莉森「母亲」斯坦内克将她的馈赠授予你。这是一种植入颈根的实验性义体，让你能通过谨慎调整配置来对整个系统超频。",
    "The next evolution is near, a union of man and machine. A synthesis greater than the birth of the human organism. Time spent with the gift has allowed for acclimatization of the invasive augment and the toll it takes upon your frame, granting a 5% reduced penalty to all stats.": "下一次进化即将到来——人与机器的结合。一种超越人类有机体诞生的融合。与馈赠相处的时光让你逐渐适应了这具侵入性的改造及其对肉体的损耗，所有属性的惩罚降低至 5%。",
    "The synthesis of human and machine is nothing to fear. It is our destiny. You will become greater than the sum of our parts. As One. Embrace your gift fully and wholly free of its accursed toll. Serenity brings tranquility in the form of no longer suffering a stat penalty.": "人机融合无需恐惧，这是我们的命运。你将超越各部分之和，浑然一体。完全拥抱你的馈赠，彻底摆脱那该死的损耗。安宁以不再承受属性惩罚的形式降临。",
    "The NEMEAN Subdermal Weave is a thin, lightweight, graphene plating that houses a dilatant fluid. The material is implanted underneath the skin, and is the most advanced form of defensive enhancement that has ever been created. The dilatant fluid, despite being thin and light, is extremely effective at stopping piercing blows and reducing blunt trauma. The properties of graphene allow the plating to mitigate damage from any fire or electrical traumas.": "尼密安皮下织甲是一层轻薄、内含增稠流体的石墨烯护板。该材料植入皮肤之下，是最先进的防御强化。增稠流体虽轻薄，却极擅长格挡穿刺打击、削弱钝击伤害；石墨烯的性质使护板能减免一切火焰与电击伤害。",
    "A small cranial implant that continuously uses weak electrical signals to stimulate the brain and induce stronger synaptic activity. This improves the user's cognitive abilities.": "一种小型颅部植入体，持续以微弱电信号刺激大脑、诱发更强的突触活动，从而提升使用者的认知能力。",
    "The myofibrils in human muscles are injected with special chemicals that react with the proteins inside the myofibrils, altering their underlying structure. The end result is muscles that are stronger and more elastic. Scientists have named these artificially enhanced units 'synfibrils'.": "向肌肉中的肌原纤维注入特殊化学物质，与其内部蛋白质反应、改变其基础结构，使肌肉更强、更具弹性。科学家将这些人工强化的单元命名为「合成肌原纤维」。",
    "This advanced artificial heart, created from plasteel and graphene, is capable of pumping blood more efficiently than an organic heart.": "这颗以塑料钢与石墨烯制造的先进人造心脏，泵血效率远超有机心脏。",
    "TITN is a series of viruses that targets and alters the sequences of human DNA in genes that control personality. The TITN-41 strain alters these genes so that the subject becomes more outgoing and sociable.": "TITN 是一系列病毒，靶向并改写控制人格的人类 DNA 序列。TITN-41 株系会改变这些基因，使受试者更外向、更善于社交。",
    "A cranial implant that is embedded within the inner ear structures and optic nerves. It regulates and enhances balance and hand-eye coordination.": "植入内耳结构与视神经中的颅部芯片，调节并增强平衡感与手眼协调。",
    "This upgraded version of the 'Augmented Targeting' implant is capable of augmenting reality by digitally displaying weaknesses and vital signs of threats.": "「强化瞄准」的升级版，能以数字化方式显示威胁的弱点与生命体征，实现增强现实。",
    "The latest version of the 'Augmented Targeting' implant adds the ability to lock-on and track threats.": "「强化瞄准」最新版新增了锁定与追踪威胁的能力。",
    "A highly advanced bionic hand. This prosthetic not only enhances the user's strength and dexterity, but is also embedded with hardware and firmware that lets them connect to, access, and hack devices and machines by just touching them.": "高度先进的仿生手。这只义肢不仅增强使用者的力量与灵巧，还内嵌软硬件，只需触碰即可连接、访问并入侵设备与机器。",
    "An experimental augmentation that lets the user make incredible leaps of insight and flights of fancy. Created by a mysterious figure known only as 'The Sculptor', this augmentation appears as a set of silvery metallic patterns on the user's upper back and shoulders. Awarded to those who discover the secrets of the labyrinth.": "一种实验性义体，让使用者实现惊人的洞察飞跃与天马行空。它由自称「雕塑家」的神秘人物创造，外观是使用者上背与肩部的一组银色金属纹路。授予那些揭开迷宫秘密的人。",
    "Modeled after the winged boots of mythology, this implant somehow provides tireless social energy to the user. Its creator, the enigmatic Sculptor, refuses to reveal the details of how it works, and only mutters about 'liveware APIs'. Awarded to those who discover the secrets of the labyrinth.": "仿照神话中的飞靴制成，这种植入体不知为何赋予使用者不知疲倦的社交精力。它神秘的创造者「雕塑家」拒绝透露原理，只喃喃提及「活体软件 API」。授予那些揭开迷宫秘密的人。",
    "This unique augmentation allows the user to strike straight to the heart of the matter and sweep aside obstacles in the way of their goals. Appearing as a simple insignia on the user's forearm, its true function is unknown. It is said to be one of the tools of The Sculptor. Awarded to those who discover the secrets of the labyrinth.": "这件独特的义体让使用者直击要害、荡平通往目标路上的障碍。它形如使用者前臂上的一枚简单纹章，真实功能成谜。据说它是「雕塑家」的工具之一。授予那些揭开迷宫秘密的人。",
    "This skeletal augmentation greatly enhances the user's durability and health. Inspired by the original Staff of Medicine that is said to have been given to Daedalus as a reward for the completion of the Labyrinth, which all modern augments are a descendant of.": "这件骨骼义体大幅提升使用者的耐久与健康。其灵感据说是赐予代达罗斯、作为完成迷宫之奖赏的原初医杖——一切现代义体皆为其后裔。",
    "An advanced neural implant that integrates Bayesian inference algorithms into the brain's decision-making processes. This augmentation enhances the user's ability to assess probabilities, predict outcomes, and adapt strategies in real-time, making them exceptionally persuasive and confident in negotiations and social interactions. Awarded to those who discover the secrets of the labyrinth.": "一种先进神经植入体，将贝叶斯推断算法融入大脑决策过程。它增强使用者实时评估概率、预测结果、调整策略的能力，使他们在谈判与社交中极具说服力与自信。授予那些揭开迷宫秘密的人。",
    "A cutting-edge neural implant that leverages Solomonoff induction to analyze and predict patterns with unparalleled precision. This augmentation enhances the user's ability to deduce optimal strategies and make compelling arguments, turning every interaction into a calculated success. The technique is sometimes referred to as Solomonoff's Lightsaber, as it is a more powerful version of Occam's razor. The final augment awarded to those who discover the secrets of the labyrinth.": "一种前沿神经植入体，借助所罗门诺夫归纳以无与伦比的精度分析与预测模式。它增强使用者推导最优策略、构建雄辩论证的能力，把每一次互动都化为算无遗策的成功。该技术有时被称为「所罗门诺夫光剑」——奥卡姆剃刀的更强版本。这是授予揭开迷宫秘密者的最后一件义体。",
    "It's time to leave the cave.": "是时候走出洞穴了。",
    "Penta-dynamo-neurovascular-valve inserted in the carpal ligament, enhances dexterity.": "插入腕韧带的五动力神经血管瓣，增强灵巧。",
    "An experimental nanobot injection. Its unstable nature leads to unpredictable results based on your circadian rhythm.": "一种实验性纳米机器人注射。其不稳定特性会依据你的昼夜节律产生无法预测的结果。",
    "A synthetic symbiotic virus that is injected into human brain tissue. The Vangelis virus heightens the senses and focus of its host while also enhancing their intuition.": "一种注入人脑组织的合成共生病毒。范吉利斯病毒会提升宿主的感官与专注，同时增强直觉。",
    "An improved version of Vangelis, a synthetic symbiotic virus that is injected into human brain tissue. On top of the benefits of the original virus, this also grants accelerated healing and enhanced reflexes.": "范吉利斯的改进版本——一种注入人脑组织的合成共生病毒。除原版功效外，还带来加速愈合与更强反射。",
    "A copy of the WKS harmonizer from the MIA leader of the Shadows of Anarchy injects *Γ-based cells that provide general enhancement to the body.": "从失踪的无政府阴影领袖处获得的 WKS 均衡器复制品，注入基于 *Γ 的细胞，为身体提供全面强化。",
    "Synthetic nerve-enhancements are injected into all major parts of the somatic nervous system, supercharging the spread of neural signals and increasing reflex speed.": "合成神经增强剂被注入躯体神经系统的所有主要部位，为神经信号传导充能，提升反射速度。",
    "A connective brain implant to SASHA that focuses on pattern recognition and predictive templating.": "一种连接 SASHA 的脑部植入体，专注于模式识别与预测模板。",
    "A connective brain implant that greatly increases the user's speech reaction time. This allows the user to think faster and respond quicker in negotiations, and always have the last word.": "一种连接型脑部植入体，大幅缩短使用者的言语反应时间。让使用者在谈判中思考更快、回应更及时，永远赢下最后一句话。",
    "A concoction of advanced nanobots that is orally ingested into the body. These nanobots induce physiological changes and significantly improve the body's functioning in all aspects.": "一组先进纳米机器人的合剂，经口服摄入体内。这些纳米机器人引发生理变化，全面提升身体机能。",
    "Zoë's Omnicerebrum Ënhancer for sleeves inserts an omnicerebrum into your sleeve. An omnicerebrum is a near perfect simulation of the human brain, allowing it to take advantage of a larger variety of augments. But you should know about this, BitRunner, since you have one of these yourself!": "Zoë 的全脑增强器为分身植入一颗全脑（omnicerebrum）。全脑是对人脑近乎完美的模拟，让分身能利用更多种类的义体。BitRunner，你应该对这事不陌生——因为你自己就有一颗！",
  });

  // ============ src/Augmentation：特殊效果文本（stats）============
  BitburnerZH.exact({
    "This augmentation makes the Bribe minigame easier by indicating the incorrect paths.": "该义体通过标示错误选项来降低「贿赂」小游戏难度。",
    "Grants access to unimaginable power.": "赋予难以想象的力量。",
    "This augmentation allows you to perform Bladeburner actions and other actions (such as working, committing crimes, etc.) at the same time.": "该义体允许你同时进行刃行者行动与其他行动（如工作、犯罪等）。",
    "This augmentation makes the Backwards minigame easier by flipping the words.": "该义体通过翻转文字来降低「倒读」小游戏难度。",
    "This Augmentation removes the Entropy virus, and prevents it from affecting you again.": "该义体会移除熵病毒，并防止它再次影响你。",
    "Developed by a pioneer in Grafting research, this implant generates pulses of stability which seem to have a nullifying effect against the Entropy virus.": "该植入体由移植研究先驱开发，可持续释放稳定脉冲，似乎对熵病毒有中和效果。",
    "Note: For unknown reasons, the lowercase 'v' appears to be an integral component to its functionality.": "注：原因不明，小写字母 'v' 似乎是其功能的必要组成部分。",
    "Many hackers say that they can spoof money much better than normal after installing this augmentation.": "许多黑客表示，安装该义体后伪造资金的能力远超以往。",
    "A leaked document from ECorp contains this weird message: \"vnmehidi's gorw oprwe si ebesaccisl aiv sliguntayir\".": "E公司一份泄露文件中写着这句怪话：\"vnmehidi's gorw oprwe si ebesaccisl aiv sliguntayir\"。",
    "This augmentation makes the Symbol matching minigame easier by indicating the correct choice.": "该义体通过标示正确选项来降低「符号匹配」小游戏难度。",
    "This augmentation makes the Minesweeper minigame easier by showing the location of all mines and keeping their position.": "该义体通过显示并保持所有地雷位置来降低「扫雷」小游戏难度。",
    "This augmentation makes the Wire Cutting minigame easier by indicating the incorrect wires.": "该义体通过标示错误导线来降低「剪线」小游戏难度。",
    "This augmentation makes the Slash minigame easier by showing you via an indicator when the sentinel is distracted.": "该义体通过指示器提示哨兵分神的时机来降低「劈砍」小游戏难度。",
    "This augmentation removes the penalty for not focusing on actions such as working in a job or working for a faction.": "该义体消除了不专注于行动（如公司工作、派系工作）时的惩罚。",
    "Its unstable nature decreases all your stats by 10%.": "其不稳定特性使你的所有属性降低 10%。",
    "The penalty for the gift is reduced to 5%.": "馈赠的惩罚降至 5%。",
    "Stanek's Gift has no penalty.": "斯塔内克的馈赠不再有惩罚。",
    "This augmentation increases the stasis link limit by one, and raises charisma by 5% and agility by 10%, and darknet money by 30%.": "该义体使停滞链接上限 +1，魅力提升 5%，敏捷提升 10%，暗网资金收益提升 30%。",
    "This augmentation increases the speed of authentication and heartbleed by 20%, and raises charisma and dexterity by 6%.": "该义体使认证与心脏出血（heartbleed）的速度提升 20%，魅力与灵巧提升 6%。",
    "This augmentation increases the stasis link limit by one, and raises charisma by 7%, strength by 10%, and darknet money by 10%.": "该义体使停滞链接上限 +1，魅力提升 7%，力量提升 10%，暗网资金收益提升 10%。",
    "This augmentation increases the stasis link limit by one, and raises charisma xp, defense, and darknet money by 10%.": "该义体使停滞链接上限 +1，魅力经验、防御与暗网资金收益提升 10%。",
    "This augmentation raises charisma by 9%, company rep by 5%, and darknet money by 15%.": "该义体使魅力提升 9%，公司声望提升 5%，暗网资金收益提升 15%。",
    "This augmentation raises charisma, hacking, darknet money, and company rep by 10%.": "该义体使魅力、黑客、暗网资金收益与公司声望提升 10%。",
    "This augmentation makes the Cheat Code minigame easier by showing what character will come next.": "该义体通过预告下一个字符来降低「作弊码」小游戏难度。",
    "This augmentation makes the Bracket minigame easier by removing all '[' ']'.": "该义体通过移除所有「[」「]」来降低「括号」小游戏难度。",
    "This augmentation makes many aspects of infiltration easier and more productive via increased timer and rewards, reduced damage taken, etc.": "该义体在诸多方面让潜入行动更轻松、更有收益：延长计时、提高奖励、减少受伤等。",
    "Allows sleeves to benefit from Stanek's Gift, but is less powerful if several are installed.": "允许分身受益于斯塔内克的馈赠；同时安装多个则效果减弱。",
  });
  BitburnerZH.patterns([
    [/^This special augmentation can be leveled up infinitely\. Each level of this augmentation increases MOST multipliers by 1% \(\+([\d.]+)%\), stacking multiplicatively\.$/, "这件特殊义体可无限升级。每一级使大多数倍率提升 1%（+$1），按乘算叠加。"],
  ]);

  // ============ src/Infiltration：小游戏 UI、消息与选项 ============
